@startuml lease-recovery
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
title Single-Host Recovery and Stale-Result Rejection
autonumber
participant "Supervisor" as S
database "SQLite" as DB
participant "Stage process group\nattempt 1 + watchdog" as Old #F3E8FF
collections "Local artifacts +\nGPU UUID OS lock" as Files
participant "Replacement stage\nattempt 2" as New #F3E8FF

S -> DB : Claim task; persist token and deadline
S -> Old : Spawn isolated process session
Old -> Files : Acquire exclusive physical-device lock
Old -> DB : Record PID, start time and process group\nHeartbeat with current attempt token
Old -> Files : Atomic complete checkpoint + checksum manifest
S -> S : Supervisor interruption / restart
S -> DB : Recover durable task and attempt state
note over S,Old
New supervisor holds the singleton lock.
Old stage may still be running; a missed heartbeat
alone is not evidence that the GPU is free.
end note
S -> Old : Verify PID + start time + attempt identity\nRequest stop of exact process group
Old -> Old : Watchdog also stops on controller loss / deadline
Old --> S : Process group exits
S -> Files : Confirm exclusive device lock is available
S -> DB : Fence old attempt; schedule bounded retry
S -> New : Spawn with new token and compatible checkpoint
New -> Files : Acquire device lock; verify checkpoint hashes
New -> New : Restore LoRA + optimizer + scheduler + scaler\nRNG + sample position + augmentation state
Old -> DB : Any late completion using old token
DB --> Old : Reject stale or terminal attempt
New -> Files : Write adapter / evaluation / complete manifests
New -> DB : Guard token, live lease and job state\nComplete stage and enqueue successor atomically
note over S,New
Cancel waits for confirmed termination before CANCELLED.
Publication checks exact artifact/report hashes and job uniqueness.
Uncalibrated results register only as UNVERIFIED.
end note
@enduml
